flowchart LR
    Admin[Placement Admin]
    Student[Student]
    TA[TA / Faculty]
    Roles[All authenticated roles]
    Auth((1.0 Authentication and Roles))
    Placement((2.0 Placement Track))
    Academic((3.0 Academic Dropbox))
    Audit((4.0 Reminder and Audit))
    D1[(D1 Users and Roles)]
    D2[(D2 Placement Data)]
    D3[(D3 Academic Data)]
    D4[(D4 Audit and Reminder Logs)]

    Roles -->|credentials| Auth
    Auth -->|role context| Placement
    Auth -->|role context| Academic
    Admin -->|round and checklist data| Placement
    Placement -->|publication status| Admin
    Student -->|checklist updates| Placement
    Placement -->|rounds and readiness| Student
    Student -->|submission file| Academic
    Academic -->|late result, grade and feedback| Student
    TA -->|assignment, review and grade| Academic
    Academic -->|submission data| TA
    Auth <--> D1
    Placement <--> D2
    Academic <--> D3
    Placement -->|publish event| Audit
    Academic -->|workflow event| Audit
    Audit <--> D4
